\\bar x\\in A^n\\;\n\\bigl(I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{fun},n}(f)(\\bar x)\\in A\\bigr)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Constants and functions are read through the explicit interpretation maps supplied by the structure code; the assertion no longer relies on undeclared superscript notation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}_S$ (structure predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Univ},L.\\mathrm{Cst},L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{cst}},I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{fun},n}$ (language projections and structure-interpretation maps, see [[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,\\mathcal M,L\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\ma